" end="00:32.943">like</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.303" end="00:36.327"><span begin="00:33.303" end="00:33.687">Where </span><span begin="00:33.687" end="00:34.080">did </span><span begin="00:34.080" end="00:34.521">we </span><span begin="00:34.521" end="00:35.015">go </span><span begin="00:35.015" end="00:36.327">wrong</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.586" end="00:39.735"><span begin="00:36.586" end="00:37.066">Been </span><span begin="00:37.066" end="00:37.514">here </span><span begin="00:37.514" end="00:37.831">for </span><span begin="00:37.831" end="00:38.279">so </span><span begin="00:38.279" end="00:38.865">long </span><span begin="00:38.865" end="00:39.168">I </span><span begin="00:39.168" end="00:39.456">don't </span><span begin="00:39.456" end="00:39.735">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.048" end="00:43.047"><span begin="00:40.048" end="00:40.488">How </span><span begin="00:40.488" end="00:40.929">did </span><span begin="00:40.929" end="00:41.288">we </span><span begin="00:41.288" end="00:41.729">get </span><span begin="00:41.729" end="00:42.544">like </span><span begin="00:42.544" end="00:43.047">this</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.184" end="00:45.667"><span begin="00:43.184" end="00:43.465">Maybe </span><span begin="00:43.465" end="00:43.915">I </span><span begin="00:43.915" end="00:44.232">got </span><span begin="00:44.232" end="00:44.808">too </span><span begin="00:45.072" end="00:45.667">attached</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.857" end="00:49.591"><span begin="00:45.857" end="00:46.504">I </span><span begin="00:46.504" end="00:47.367">never </span><span begin="00:47.367" end="00:47.831">had </span><span begin="00:47.831" end="00:48.191">a </span><span begin="00:48.191" end="00:49.120">choice </span><span begin="00:49.120" end="00:49.591">no</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.159" end="00:53.159"><span begin="00:50.159" end="00:50.655">Hear </span><span begin="00:50.655" end="00:50.967">it </sp